# Mauler is 2/1. Magda's "Whenever a Dwarf you control becomes tapped, create a Treasure token" is gone too: the Mauler attacks
# in turn 4 and no Treasure is made. Magda is a 1/1 Skeleton, no longer a Dwarf.

